<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS7" title="In Appendix B Dataset Splits and Categories ‣ RepIt: Representing Isolated Targets to Steer Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.7 </span>Similar Category Evaluations</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS8" title="In Appendix B Dataset Splits and Categories ‣ RepIt: Representing Isolated Targets to Steer Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.8 </span>Tailweight Analyses</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
