<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">RepIt: Representing Isolated Targets to Steer
Language Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Vincent Siu
